*.escaped.json

# Resolved system prompts (build artifacts). The source of truth is the
# *.md with the {{...}} marker; the resolved *.generated.md is rebuilt by
# `npm run build:prompt` (wired into pretest). It is ~99% identical to its
# source, so committing it would invite editing the wrong copy → list drift.
*.generated.md
